section titles (COMPUTER SETTINGS / USER SETTINGS, Applied GPOs / filtered GPOs / security groups) should become columns of the rows beneath them, and the 'Filtering:' / 'WMI Filter:' lines belong to the GPO row above; format 1 cannot carry section context, so the list items are one 'items' table, every 'Key: value' line (both sections) one 'settings' table, the DNs their own table, and the RSOP line one row.
